# Daily feedback sync via cron (alternative to the systemd timer).
#
# Install with:   crontab -e   (paste the line below, edit paths)
# Verify with:    crontab -l
#
# Runs every day at 02:30. Loads .env, activates the venv, logs to a file.
# The trailing redirect captures cron's own stderr in addition to the app log.

30 2 * * * cd /opt/feedback-sync && set -a && . ./.env && set +a && ./.venv/bin/python main.py >> ./logs/cron.log 2>&1
